Feature: Test to check if the correct approver are added automatically

  @ApprovalMatrix @DoubleItem @All @Run2
  Scenario Outline: Create 2 item, assign to an SCO and check the added approvers
    Given the <UserType> user login is successful
    And close open tabs if any
    When user tries to create <Item1> part with Design Team as <DesignTeam1> and Design Approval Category as <DACType1>
    And item is added to a change of type <ChangeType> for NA
    When user tries to create <Item2> part with Design Team as <DesignTeam2> and Design Approval Category as <DACType2>
    And item is added to a change of type <ChangeType> for <SpecialCase>
    Then approvers <ApproverRoles> added in stage <WorkflowStage>
